# FSD architecture

Read `docs/fsd-architecture.md` for the maintained architecture policy and `docs/PROJECT_FACTS.md` for the current module map.

- Determine the owning layer and data source before adding files. Do not generate types/API/store/UI/page scaffolding by default.
- Respect the layer direction and documented exceptions; a same-layer import is not automatically valid.
- Import concrete modules as described in `no-barrel-index.mdc`.
- Keep a new cross-cutting decision in the architecture document or a focused ADR when needed, not in another duplicate rule.
